        "original_id": "8adc41ff-247d-5f11-975d-754dbd744db2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: R. D. Reid, Zack Snyder, George A. Romero, James Gunn, Sarah Polley, Ving Rhames, Jake Weber, Mekhi Phifer, Kevin Zegers\n- Products: Dawn of the Dead (1978 film), Dawn of the Dead (2004 film), Diary of the Dead, Transamerica, It's a Boy Girl Thing, The Jane Austen Book Club, Fifty Dead Men Walking, Frozen\n\nFacts:\n- George A. Romero created the 1978 film \"Dawn of the Dead.\"\n- The 2004 film \"Dawn of the Dead\" is a remake of George A. Romero's 1978 film of the same name.\n- James Gunn wrote the 2004 film \"Dawn of the Dead.\"\n- Zack Snyder's 2004 film \"Dawn of the Dead\" stars Sarah Polley, Ving Rhames, Jake Weber, and Mekhi Phifer.\n- R. D. Reid appeared in Zack Snyder's \"Dawn of the Dead\" and in George A. Romero's \"Diary of the Dead.\"\n- Kevin Zegers starred in \"Dawn of the Dead\" in 2004, \"Transamerica\" in 2005, \"It's a Boy Girl Thing\" in 2006, \"The Jane Austen Book Club\" in 2007, \"Fifty Dead Men Walking\" in 2008, and \"Frozen\" in 2010.",
